Protectli Vault: Serves as the dedicated perimeter firewall, running a security appliance OS to handle edge routing, NAT, stateful packet inspection, and intra-VLAN firewall rules.
Cisco Switch: Acts as the central layer-2 switching fabric, supplying wired connectivity and handling 802.1Q trunking to pass VLAN traffic across the network.
